From: Bartlomiej Zolnierkiewicz <b.zolnierkie@samsung.com>
Subject: [RFC PATCH 1/4] ARM: remove big.LITTLE switcher support
Date: Mon, 27 Jun 2016 13:26:07 +0200
Message-ID: <1467026770-5699-2-git-send-email-b.zolnierkie@samsung.com>
References: <1467026770-5699-1-git-send-email-b.zolnierkie@samsung.com>
